{"id":"2610.30067","authors":[{"_id":"6adc5f33121a70fc68345b6d","name":"Quang Anh Kiet Tran","hidden":false},{"_id":"6adc5f33121a70fc68345b6e","name":"Nam Anh Tran","hidden":false},{"_id":"6adc5f33121a70fc68345b6f","name":"Manh Hung Trinh","hidden":false},{"_id":"6adc5f33121a70fc68345b70","name":"Thanh Danh Le","hidden":false},{"_id":"6adc5f33121a70fc68345b71","name":"Khang Nhat Hoang Vo","hidden":false},{"_id":"6adc5f33121a70fc68345b72","name":"Huynh Dai Nhan Tran","hidden":false}],"publishedAt":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z","title":"GoiBERT: Compact Vietnamese Language Models via Two-Stage Knowledge Distillation","summary":"Vietnamese pre-trained encoders have improved rapidly, but the strongest ones are large, multilingual-vocabulary models or depend on external word segmentation, which makes them costly to deploy. We present GoiBERT, a family of two compact Vietnamese encoders with 26M and 49M parameters that operate directly on raw text. GoiBERT learns from two complementary teachers. A same-tokenizer Vietnamese encoder first teaches general-purpose representations. A much larger teacher then provides task-level guidance through soft labels that are generated without ever labeling its own training data. Across eight benchmarks covering text classification, aspect-based sentiment analysis, natural language inference, and named entity recognition, GoiBERT-large achieves the highest average score among non-teacher models. It does so with fewer than half the parameters of the strongest compact baseline and twice its throughput. GoiBERT-base retains 99% of that baseline's performance at a quarter of its size. Our analysis shows that compression is nearly lossless for sentiment and classification tasks but remains costly for inference and entity recognition, which points to clear directions for future work. Our code and models are available at: https://github.com/Nhantran65/GoiBERT.git","upvotes":0,"discussionId":"6adc5f33121a70fc68345b73","ai_summary":"GoiBERT is a compact Vietnamese encoder family that uses dual-teacher distillation to achieve high performance with far fewer parameters and faster inference than larger baselines.","ai_keywords":["pre-trained encoders","GoiBERT","knowledge distillation","soft labels","text classification","aspect-based sentiment analysis","natural language inference","named entity recognition"],"ai_summary_model":"thinkingmachines/Inkling-Small","linkedModels":[{"author":"TwoheartsTechnologies","authorData":{"_id":"6a92fa5e7e48d2425113f24c","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6a92fa5e7e48d2425113f24c/z3n3B1qIEblD7FEWzfPLd.jpeg","fullname":"Twohearts Technologies","name":"TwoheartsTechnologies","type":"user","isPro":false,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"isUserFollowing":false},"downloads":8,"gated":false,"id":"TwoheartsTechnologies/GoiBERT-S","availableInferenceProviders":[],"lastModified":"2026-10-24T07:33:10.000Z","likes":1,"private":false,"repoType":"model","isLikedByUser":false,"numParameters":26397696},{"author":"TwoheartsTechnologies","authorData":{"_id":"6a92fa5e7e48d2425113f24c","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6a92fa5e7e48d2425113f24c/z3n3B1qIEblD7FEWzfPLd.jpeg","fullname":"Twohearts Technologies","name":"TwoheartsTechnologies","type":"user","isPro":false,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"isUserFollowing":false},"downloads":9,"gated":false,"id":"TwoheartsTechnologies/GoiBERT-M","availableInferenceProviders":[],"lastModified":"2026-10-24T07:33:06.000Z","likes":1,"private":false,"repoType":"model","isLikedByUser":false,"numParameters":49366016}],"numTotalModels":2,"linkedDatasets":[],"numTotalDatasets":0,"linkedSpaces":[],"numTotalSpaces":0}